{"parentUuid":"68aef57a-2be2-451c-a503-aeb880dae054","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b8557a2-9430-4f17-946a-1ea07dab5643","agentId":"adfaf6893cfeed936","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013Qgoi8iavqvifTLnJNqq8C","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# Hooks\n25:| During a turn                     | `PreToolUse`, `PermissionRequest`, `PostToolUse`, `PreCompact`, `PostCompact`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `SubagentStop`, `Stop` |\n30:## Where Codex looks for hooks\n62:## Review and trust hooks\n80:## Config shape\n84:- A hook event such as `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `PreCompact`,\n204:matcher = \"^compact$\"\n230:## MCP tool hooks\n236:### Configure an MCP tool hook\n272:### Expand arguments from the hook event\n299:### Execution and lifecycle\n312:## Turn hooks off\n325:## Managed hooks from `requirements.toml`\n375:## Plugin-bundled hooks\n410:## Matcher patterns\n422:| `PostCompact`       | compaction trigger     | Values are `manual` or `auto`                                |\n423:| `PreCompact`        | compaction trigger     | Values are `manual` or `auto`                                |\n426:| `SessionStart`      | start source           | Values are `startup`, `resume`, `clear`, and `compact`       |\n442:- `startup|resume|clear|compact`\n445:### Tool coverage\n467:## Common input fields\n494:## Common output fields\n496:`SessionStart`, `PreCompact`, `PostCompact`, `UserPromptSubmit`,\n527:### Large hook output\n568:## Run hooks in the background\n574:### Configure a background hook\n617:### How background hooks run\n636:### Limitations\n646:## Hooks\n648:### SessionStart\n656:| `source` | `string` | How the session started: `startup`, `resume`, `clear`, or `compact` |\n674:After Codex compacts a root session, `SessionStart` hooks that match\n675:`source: \"compact\"` run before the next model request. This also applies when\n676:automatic compaction happens in the middle of a turn: Codex delivers the hook's\n681:### SessionEnd\n718:### SubagentStart\n748:### PreToolUse\n830:### PermissionRequest\n890:### PostToolUse\n943:#### Tool calls from code mode\n957:### PreCompact\n959:`PreCompact` runs before Codex compacts the chat. `matcher` is applied\n967:| `trigger` | `string` | What triggered compaction: `manual` or `auto`  |\n972:matching `PreCompact` hook returns `continue: false`, Codex stops before\n973:compacting.\n975:### PostCompact\n977:`PostCompact` runs after Codex compacts the chat. `matcher` is applied\n985:| `trigger` | `string` | What triggered compaction: `manual` or `auto`  |\n990:matching `PostCompact` hook returns `continue: false`, Codex stops after\n991:compacting.\ncodex.js","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f81e7e60-7aa6-40f0-bd29-7f1d0c5b31e5","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:47:20.578Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"68aef57a-2be2-451c-a503-aeb880dae054","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-adfaf6893cfeed936","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"claude/capabilities-matrix-impl-2a0cfd"}
