{"parentUuid":"642f172a-a593-4d60-b198-6d0d554d00d1","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"adfaf6893cfeed936","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffWNpyGEpLQNwoY7Xw29","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01443rL75VmavL8hkKbf9SAe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='spec/capabilities/manual-compaction.yaml'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\n\"\"\",\"\"\"  codex:\n    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#precompact\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#postcompact\n    runs:\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-auto\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-auto-blocked\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-slash\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          A non-interactive run cannot request a compaction: the real codex exec\n          sends /compact to the model as ordinary prompt text, and no hook fires\n          (recorded: runs/manual-compaction-slash). What was recorded is\n          Codex compacting by itself at its context limit, trigger \"auto\", with\n          PreCompact, then PostCompact, then SessionStart with source \"compact\"\n          (runs/manual-compaction-auto); the docs name the trigger \"manual\" for\n          the /compact command of an interactive session, which no run shows.\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          /compact is a slash command, and no mock parses one: a scenario script\n          requests the compaction by a Compact tool call naming the trigger\n          (\"manual\" when it names none), and the mock has no context limit, so it\n          never compacts by itself.\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          A PreCompact hook printing continue: false stops the compaction, as\n          recorded (no compaction record, no PostCompact, no SessionStart), but\n          Codex also aborts the whole turn then (turn_aborted, exit status 1, no\n          Stop hook; runs/manual-compaction-auto-blocked) and the mock lets the\n          turn go on. The compaction itself keeps no summary: the mock records\n          that it happened, with an empty replacement history.\n  cursor:\n    supported: false\n    reason: Cursor's headless agent has no compaction request (/compress is plain prompt text and no hook fires), preCompact is an observational hook that cannot stop a compaction, and no hook fires after one.\n    runs:\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-slash\n    docs:\n      - https://cursor.com/docs/hooks#precompact\n\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit status --short"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_read_input_tokens":163536,"output_tokens":946,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":509},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":946,"cache_read_input_tokens":163536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":509,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01443rL75VmavL8hkKbf9SAe":{"command":"cd /Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-adfaf6893cfeed936 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='spec/capabilities/manual-compaction.yaml'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\n\"\"\",\"\"\"  codex:\n    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#precompact\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#postcompact\n    runs:\n      - codex-moc