{"parentUuid":"5310ee4a-f421-4509-94c3-314fee9af84d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"adfaf6893cfeed936","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KHqHvK2z7rpY1gsRsrnVvu","type":"tool_result","content":"          surfaces that error is not modeled. A blocked automatic compaction is\n          skipped and the conversation continues uncompacted.\n  codex:\n    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#precompact\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#postcompact\n    runs:\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-auto\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-auto-blocked\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-slash\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          A non-interactive run cannot request a compaction: the real codex exec\n          sends /compact to the model as ordinary prompt text, and no hook fires\n          (recorded: runs/manual-compaction-slash). What was recorded is\n          Codex compacting by itself at its context limit, trigger \"auto\", with\n          PreCompact, then PostCompact, then SessionStart with source \"compact\"\n          (runs/manual-compaction-auto); the docs name the trigger \"manual\" for\n          the /compact command of an interactive session, which no run shows.\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          /compact is a slash command, and no mock parses one: a scenario script\n          requests the compaction with a compact control record naming the\n          trigger (\"manual\" when it names none), and the mock has no context limit, so it\n          never compacts by itself.\n  cursor:\n    supported: false\n    reason: Cursor's headless agent has no compaction request (/compress is plain prompt text and no hook fires), preCompact is an observational hook that cannot stop a compaction, and no hook fires after one.\n    runs:\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/manual-compaction-slash\n    docs:\n      - https://cursor.com/docs/hooks#precompact","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"742626b3-dd58-4466-8f3c-fa8c7df42f8d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:28:57.801Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5310ee4a-f421-4509-94c3-314fee9af84d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-adfaf6893cfeed936","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a4d84e01b97891e91"}
